 4. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 AI's cyber risks are moving too fast for defenders to decide how to fight them. (Axios) Grok Bot — SpaceXAI's new tool that acts as a swarm of AI agents — drafts emails, signs into apps and websites, remembers previous tasks and is designed to act autonomously to simplify task delegation. (Bloomberg) 
 
